a failing scenario pinpoints the behavior that regressed.
## Compatibility and limitations
Covers the pinned behavior only; fixture data is local to this spec.
# @manual: primary
REQ-COMPILER-SFFI-V2-001
doc/01_research/compiler/REQ-COMPILER-SFFI-V2-001.md
doc/03_plan/compiler/REQ-COMPILER-SFFI-V2-001.md
doc/04_architecture/compiler/REQ-COMPILER-SFFI-V2-001.md
